{"suttaId":"tha-ap242","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8096,8110],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap242:0.3":"Vāsidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap242:1.1":"“Kammārohaṃ pure āsiṃ, tivarāyaṃ puruttame;","tha-ap242:1.3":"Ekā vāsi mayā dinnā, sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ [sayambhumhiparājite (?)].","tha-ap242:2.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ vāsimadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap242:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, vāsidānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap242:3.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap242:4.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vāsidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap242:5.1":"Vāsidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap242:6.1":"Udakāsanavaggo catuvīsatimo.","tha-ap242:7.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap242:8.1":"Udakāsanabhājanaṃ, sālapupphī kilañjako;","tha-ap242:8.3":"Vedikā vaṇṇakāro ca, piyālaambayāgado;","tha-ap242:8.5":"Jagatī vāsidātā ca, gāthā tiṃsa ca aṭṭha ca."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
